@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@schoolId = 52426aab-497c-4880-8f8a-ad8a385f6e2b
@termId = 7d976448-4163-498c-b44a-452093eb121d
@windowId = c3604efe-33c5-477f-9732-e9587d7f646a
@sourceTermId = 43530ca6-bd8f-4cf1-b45e-288ce29750d0
@targetTermId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Note: With cookie-based authentication, ensure your HTTP client (like VS Code REST Client)
### automatically manages and sends cookies received from login responses (e.g., via a cookie jar).
### Replace any @placeholder UUIDs below with real IDs captured from earlier responses.

# ================================================================
# ACADEMIC TERM — CRUD
# ================================================================

### 1. Create a new academic term (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/terms
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "academicYear": "2026",
  "termName": "Term 1",
  "startDate": "2026-01-05",
  "endDate": "2026-04-10",
  "status": "active",
  "isCurrentTerm": true
}

### 2. List all academic terms for a school (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 3. Get the current active academic term for a school (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/current
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 4. Get a specific academic term by ID (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 5. Update an academic term (Admin / School Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "termName": "Term 1 - Revised",
  "status": "active"
}

### 6. Delete an academic term (Super Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies


# ================================================================
# ACADEMIC TERM — ADVANCED READS
# ================================================================

### 7. Get a term with all its windows (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/with-windows
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 8. List all academic terms for a school in a specific year (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/by-year?academicYear=2026
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 9. List distinct academic years for a school (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/years
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 10. Get current term with its windows (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/current/with-windows
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 11. List terms by status (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/by-status?status=active
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 12. Count academic terms for a school (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/count
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 13. Look up a term by (year, name) (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/lookup?academicYear=2026&termName=Term%201
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies


# ================================================================
# ACADEMIC TERM — STATE TRANSITIONS
# ================================================================

### 14. Set a term as the current active term for the school (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/current
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "termId": "{{termId}}"
}

### 15. Clear the current active term for the school (Admin / School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/current
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 16. Change a term's status (Admin / School Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 17. Archive a term (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/archive
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 18. Validate whether a term is ready to activate (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/readiness
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies


# ================================================================
# TERM WINDOWS — CRUD
# ================================================================

### 19. Create a term window/sub-period e.g. Mid-Term Break (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/terms/windows
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "termId": "{{termId}}",
  "windowType": "mid_term_break",
  "title": "Term 1 Mid-Term Break",
  "startDate": "2026-02-20",
  "endDate": "2026-02-24"
}

### 20. Get a specific term window by ID (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/windows/{{windowId}}
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 21. List all windows for an academic term (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/windows
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 22. List windows for a term filtered by type (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/windows/by-type?windowType=mid_term_break
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 23. Count windows for a term (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/windows/count
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 24. Update a term window (Admin / School Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/terms/windows/{{windowId}}
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "title": "Term 1 Mid-Term Break (Extended)",
  "endDate": "2026-02-25"
}

### 25. Delete a term window (Admin / School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/terms/windows/{{windowId}}
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 26. Delete ALL windows for a term (Admin / School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/terms/{{termId}}/windows
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies


# ================================================================
# TERM WINDOWS — ADVANCED OPERATIONS
# ================================================================

### 27. Get all windows active on a specific date for a school (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/windows/active?onDate=2026-02-22
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 28. Get upcoming windows for a school (next N days) (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/terms/school/{{schoolId}}/windows/upcoming?daysAhead=30
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

### 29. Copy term windows from a source term to a target term (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/terms/windows/copy
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "sourceTermId": "{{sourceTermId}}",
  "targetTermId": "{{targetTermId}}"
}

### 30. Bulk create multiple term windows in one request (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/terms/windows/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization header removed; authentication handled automatically via HTTP cookies

{
  "termId": "{{termId}}",
  "windows": [
    {
      "windowType": "cat_week",
      "title": "CAT Week",
      "startDate": "2026-02-10",
      "endDate": "2026-02-14"
    },
    {
      "windowType": "exam_week",
      "title": "End of Term Exam Week",
      "startDate": "2026-03-23",
      "endDate": "2026-03-27"
    },
    {
      "windowType": "registration_deadline",
      "title": "Term 2 Registration Deadline",
      "startDate": "2026-04-08",
      "endDate": "2026-04-08"
    }
  ]
}